@startuml ImportExport_Customer
!theme plain

actor Customer
participant "Frontend\n/app/group-booking/page.tsx" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n/src/controllers/groupBookings.controller.ts" as API
database "MongoDB\n(Collection: groupBookings)" as DB

Customer -> Frontend: Tải template Excel
Frontend -> API: GET /group-bookings/:id/template
API -> DB: Lấy thông tin group booking
DB --> API: Group booking data
API -> API: Tạo Excel template
API --> Frontend: Excel file template
Frontend --> Customer: Download template

Customer -> Frontend: Import file Excel danh sách thành viên
Frontend -> API: POST /group-bookings/:id/upload\n(file Excel)
API -> API: Đọc và validate file Excel
API -> DB: Cập nhật members vào group booking
DB --> API: Group booking updated
API --> Frontend: Success
Frontend --> Customer: Hiển thị thành công

Customer -> Frontend: Export danh sách thành viên
Frontend -> API: GET /group-bookings/:id/members.xlsx
API -> DB: Lấy danh sách members
DB --> API: Members data
API -> API: Tạo Excel file
API --> Frontend: Excel file
Frontend --> Customer: Download file

@enduml

